cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Sieve: confidence gating for LLM cascades"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
authors:
  - family-names: Kosaraju
    given-names: Sai Niketh
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sainikethkosaraju/Sieve"
abstract: >-
  Confidence gate and OpenAI-compatible proxy for local LLM cascades: answer, escalate or abstain
  using Learn-then-Test thresholds that certify an error bound, with a pre-registered evaluation on
  two Tesla T4 GPUs. On TriviaQA the gate cut a 7B model's wrong answers about 21-fold by abstaining
  on 69% of queries; the bound held in distribution and failed under shift, and the cascade did not
  save compute for the tested model pair.
